<title>GERMANY: RWE says interested in gas provider Gasag.</title>
<headline>RWE says interested in gas provider Gasag.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>German utility group RWE AG is interested in buying into Gasag, the state-owned gas distribution company which Berlin city is keen to sell, the head of RWE Energie Roland Farnung said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Berlin owns 51.2 percent of Gasag which it plans to sell after already disposing of its stake in energy provider Bewag.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
